  "statement": "Conditional on A2-H3-CANONICAL-PRODUCTION-FUNCTIONAL, define Q[Psi]=||Psi||_L2^2/2 for the hash-pinned P1 static functional on the side-16 torus. If lambda0 is the exact torus spectral bottom, rho_star=43/216, and mu_t=lambda0-1849/86400, then F_P1[Psi]=mu_t Q+<Psi,(L-lambda0)Psi>/2+F_II[Psi]+(gamma/6) integral rho(rho-rho_star)^2. A lowest-internal-eigenvector plane wave on the unique radial shell |n|^2=3 saturates the remainders. It is an exact constrained global minimizer at Q_star=11008/27, and at every fixed charge with mean density at least rho_star. For Omega_mu=F_P1-mu Q, zero is the unique global minimizer below mu_t, coexists with nonzero shell minimizers at mu_t, and is beaten by a nonzero global minimizer above mu_t. The zero-field spinodal is lambda0 and the plane-wave amplitude saddle-node is lambda0-1849/64800, hence the coexistence transition is first order.",
